00:45:57.680 --> 00:45:59.320 line:95%
 Mayotte, plus d'eau potable. 

00:45:59.480 --> 00:46:01.600 line:95%
 -On livre des millions 
 de bouteilles ! 

00:46:01.760 --> 00:46:03.200 line:95%
 -Cette échelle interroge 

00:46:03.360 --> 00:46:05.680 line:95%
 sur les petites îles 
